WEBVTT

00:11.000 --> 00:12.130
With this money,

00:12.160 --> 00:13.190
we can totally turn that scrap yard

00:13.190 --> 00:14.250
into a restaurant.

00:15.080 --> 00:15.750
It will surely work.

00:15.750 --> 00:16.350
Can you cook?

00:16.350 --> 00:17.350
Just hire a chef!

00:17.350 --> 00:18.070
Make barbecue or something.

00:18.070 --> 00:18.800
I-I think

00:18.800 --> 00:20.230
it's a good idea
to turn it into a bathhouse.

00:20.230 --> 00:21.390
Later, with the bathhouse, we...

00:21.390 --> 00:22.230
How much does water cost?

00:22.230 --> 00:23.070
It's not a high cost.

00:23.070 --> 00:24.710
-We can definitely make a fortune.
-You know?

00:24.710 --> 00:25.280
Hey!

00:26.030 --> 00:27.190
Pay me back!

00:27.930 --> 00:29.000
♪ He is ♪

00:28.000 --> 00:29.060
This way, this way!

00:29.190 --> 00:30.160
Pay me back!

00:30.190 --> 00:30.920
Stop yelling! Stop it!

00:30.580 --> 00:32.950
♪ Too cunning but like a joke ♪

00:30.920 --> 00:31.760
Stop shouting! Do you hear me?

00:31.760 --> 00:32.880
That knife of yours is dangerous!

00:32.880 --> 00:34.280
Pay me back!

00:34.360 --> 00:35.460
♪ Ha ha ha ♪

00:36.940 --> 00:38.150
♪ He ♪

00:39.620 --> 00:42.020
♪ Wears his glamorous nails ♪

00:45.110 --> 00:46.240
This way, this way...

00:46.240 --> 00:46.940
This way works.

00:46.460 --> 00:50.010
♪ The discord between the body and soul,
a once-in-a-century mute ♪

00:50.860 --> 00:54.260
♪ Pride cell, soaked in the liquid;
he wants to keep sprouting ♪

00:52.600 --> 00:53.860
Which way are we going?

00:54.640 --> 00:55.430
Here, this way.

00:55.320 --> 00:59.010
♪ Absurd, empty, glorious—
superior beings ♪

00:59.110 --> 00:59.560
Go!

01:00.030 --> 01:04.400
♪ Smug, pure, pathetic—
this gaudy human race ♪

01:07.950 --> 01:08.710
Stop there!

01:08.920 --> 01:09.580
Don't move!

01:09.770 --> 01:11.070
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

01:10.070 --> 01:11.090
Come on, come on.

01:11.120 --> 01:11.680
Come up here. Come on.

01:11.680 --> 01:12.140
Come up.

01:12.480 --> 01:12.960
I...

01:13.000 --> 01:13.480
What?

01:13.510 --> 01:14.120
Come up. Come on.

01:14.120 --> 01:14.870
Screw you!

01:14.690 --> 01:15.620
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

01:16.590 --> 01:17.590
Come up here. Come on.

01:17.590 --> 01:18.120
What?

01:18.230 --> 01:18.789
Will you come up or not?

01:18.789 --> 01:20.000
Come up.

01:18.900 --> 01:20.060
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

01:20.070 --> 01:20.680
Get down!

01:20.789 --> 01:21.580
What?

01:21.680 --> 01:22.230
You guys...

01:22.230 --> 01:22.710
Come down!

01:22.710 --> 01:23.300
You come up here.

01:23.300 --> 01:24.430
Come down if you dare!

01:24.430 --> 01:25.280
Come up if you dare! Come on!

01:25.280 --> 01:25.840
Then you two just

01:25.840 --> 01:27.570
never ever come down if you can!

01:28.280 --> 01:29.080
-Okay.
-Okay.

01:30.100 --> 01:31.300
♪ He ♪

01:30.560 --> 01:31.680
Screw you!

01:32.990 --> 01:37.110
♪ A rusted flower etched
across his chest ♪

01:36.039 --> 01:37.509
We were quite in sync just now.

01:37.509 --> 01:38.170
Where is he?

01:39.180 --> 01:40.070
♪ Oh, he ♪

01:40.710 --> 01:41.770
What are you doing?

01:42.030 --> 01:45.180
♪ Says your worldview's still too small ♪

01:44.789 --> 01:45.560
Listen,

01:46.400 --> 01:47.870
there's only one door left there.

01:47.870 --> 01:49.160
Let's see how you two get out.

01:49.110 --> 01:52.810
♪ A rat that steals rice—
humans call it cunning ♪

01:49.200 --> 01:50.120
I'll outlast you two.

01:50.120 --> 01:51.350
-You think we're scared of you?
-You think we're scared of you?

01:51.350 --> 01:52.640
And you think I'm scared of you?

01:52.640 --> 01:53.950
I'm not scared of you!

01:53.710 --> 01:57.479
♪ A human who steals honey—
calls the bees hardworking ♪

01:53.950 --> 01:55.039
You can't scare me!

01:55.039 --> 01:55.920
Don't try to scare me!

01:55.920 --> 01:57.120
I'm not scared of you!

01:57.150 --> 01:59.820
I-I'm not scared of you!

01:58.280 --> 02:02.230
♪ Absurd, greedy—
self-proclaimed superior beings ♪

02:00.070 --> 02:01.130
What are you doing?

02:02.790 --> 02:07.340
♪ Hypocritical, wasteful, hollow—
this gaudy human race ♪

02:04.940 --> 02:07.070
I'll wait until you two can't hold out.

02:09.520 --> 02:10.560
Then wait.

02:10.630 --> 02:11.630
Fine, wait. Come on.

02:10.800 --> 02:11.840
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

02:12.120 --> 02:13.030
What? Let me see.

02:13.030 --> 02:14.000
Let me see how long you can wait.

02:14.000 --> 02:15.560
Who can not sit down? I have a seat, too.

02:15.370 --> 02:16.400
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

03:41.840 --> 03:45.600
[Born with Luck]

03:45.690 --> 03:48.600
[Episode 21]

03:51.000 --> 03:51.560
Sir,

03:53.560 --> 03:55.520
you haven't told me

03:55.630 --> 03:56.960
how to get to the office.

03:57.750 --> 03:59.150
It's on the first floor of Building 27.

03:59.150 --> 04:00.610
There's a sign at the door.

04:02.910 --> 04:04.630
Huo Zheng!

04:08.000 --> 04:09.130
Who are you calling?

04:14.080 --> 04:15.280
Huoxiang Zhengqi Pill.

04:15.280 --> 04:17.500
We call it Huozheng for short.

04:18.209 --> 04:18.800
[Wanted]

04:18.820 --> 04:19.360
[Photo of the suspect, Huo Zheng]

04:21.680 --> 04:23.360
Hurry up! I'm almost coughing to death!

04:23.360 --> 04:24.840
Fetch me some Huo Zheng!

04:24.860 --> 04:25.800
I... I'll get it.

04:30.600 --> 04:31.390
You

04:31.890 --> 04:33.510
really don't know Huo Zheng, do you?

04:33.510 --> 04:34.440
I don't know him.

04:35.480 --> 04:36.250
Hurry up!

04:38.800 --> 04:40.860
Here are the Huoxiang Zhengqi Pills.

04:41.630 --> 04:42.590
[Huoxiang Zhengqi Pill]

04:45.440 --> 04:45.710
[Photo of the suspect, Huo Zheng]

04:45.730 --> 04:46.460
[Wanted]

04:46.580 --> 04:48.830
[Huoxiang Zhengqi Pill]

04:51.560 --> 04:52.720
B-Bye.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.300
Uncle.

05:04.510 --> 05:06.040
We can't stay here anymore.

05:06.360 --> 05:07.490
We need to leave now.

05:08.510 --> 05:09.310
Immediately.

05:09.830 --> 05:10.890
We can't stay here?

05:11.040 --> 05:11.640
Go pack up!

05:21.800 --> 05:22.630
Be careful.

05:23.480 --> 05:24.310
Take it slow.

05:25.040 --> 05:25.740
Be careful.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.330
Don't let it get bumped.

05:38.510 --> 05:39.750
I'll go check that one.

05:39.750 --> 05:40.240
Chief!

05:41.430 --> 05:42.600
We found an important clue.

05:42.600 --> 05:43.220
What clue?

05:43.390 --> 05:44.870
During the inspection on Qingchun Street,

05:44.870 --> 05:46.390
someone called the name, "Huo Zheng."

05:46.390 --> 05:47.170
Was it him?

05:47.480 --> 05:49.040
The colleagues at the office said that,

05:49.040 --> 05:49.680
during the inspection,

05:49.680 --> 05:51.270
a man was
looking for Huoxiang Zhengqi Pill,

05:51.270 --> 05:52.720
and they claimed
to call it Huo Zheng for short.

05:52.720 --> 05:53.840
So he yelled, "Huo Zheng."

05:53.840 --> 05:54.840
Are you nuts?

05:54.870 --> 05:55.680
Well, I think we should

05:55.680 --> 05:56.409
go verify it.

05:56.480 --> 05:57.550
You think things are not urgent enough?

05:57.550 --> 05:58.750
There's no other way.

05:58.830 --> 06:00.390
Let's verify it just in case...

06:00.390 --> 06:00.950
Yes, sir.

06:00.990 --> 06:06.600
[Convenient Hotel]

06:01.830 --> 06:02.880
I'll go with you.

06:02.990 --> 06:05.190
I'm can't rest assured if he goes alone.

06:05.390 --> 06:06.650
Let's go to that place.

06:12.800 --> 06:13.310
Look at this!

06:13.310 --> 06:14.560
Why were you in such a hurry?

06:14.560 --> 06:15.830
I was just getting past,

06:15.830 --> 06:17.040
yet you insisted on squeezing in!

06:17.040 --> 06:18.360
I've been going straight.

06:18.360 --> 06:19.560
If you hadn't cut me off,

06:19.560 --> 06:20.510
you wouldn't be blocking the way.

06:20.510 --> 06:21.310
Calm down first.

06:21.310 --> 06:22.310
You bear full responsibility.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.190
Don't...

06:31.560 --> 06:32.240
Police.

06:42.240 --> 06:42.880
Hello?

06:42.950 --> 06:43.810
There are cops.

06:44.390 --> 06:45.050
Be careful.

06:48.270 --> 06:49.130
There are cops.

06:49.870 --> 06:50.630
Don't go any further.

06:50.630 --> 06:51.360
Not any further.

06:51.360 --> 06:52.390
Stop, stop.

06:55.270 --> 06:55.930
Are they...

06:56.950 --> 06:58.340
Are they coming for us?

06:58.370 --> 06:59.480
Yes, definitely.

06:59.500 --> 07:00.830
Otherwise, why would the boss run?

07:00.830 --> 07:02.540
Then don't look at them.

07:03.630 --> 07:04.090
Insurance!

07:04.090 --> 07:04.750
-File an insurance claim.
-Insurance claim.

07:04.750 --> 07:05.560
Why did you have to squeeze in?

07:05.560 --> 07:06.720
Everyone has insurance.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.980
-Calm down, calm down.
-Call the police.

07:09.270 --> 07:10.240
This area seriously
needs to be cleaned up.

07:10.240 --> 07:10.830
It's such a mess.

07:10.830 --> 07:12.630
Look at that car over there, too.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.010
Is he...

07:16.160 --> 07:17.290
Is he pointing at us?

07:18.430 --> 07:19.480
He's pointing at us!

07:19.480 --> 07:20.610
He's p-pointing...

07:20.950 --> 07:21.630
I'll go take a look.

07:21.630 --> 07:22.200
Okay.

07:23.000 --> 07:24.990
Are you an intellectual?

07:25.120 --> 07:26.430
I can't tell at all.

07:27.560 --> 07:28.160
Move a bit.

07:29.590 --> 07:30.190
I'm a cop.

07:31.940 --> 07:33.250
Move back a bit. You...

07:34.190 --> 07:34.920
Song Xing.

07:35.070 --> 07:35.670
Song Xing!

07:35.680 --> 07:36.180
Coming!

07:36.480 --> 07:37.140
Stop there!

08:03.080 --> 08:11.500
[Police]

08:20.360 --> 08:21.560
You caught Huo Zheng?

08:24.610 --> 08:26.410
Huo Zheng and Zhu Yifei got away.

08:27.070 --> 08:28.720
We must pin them down at Sanjiangkou.

08:28.720 --> 08:30.320
Let's keep looking for them.

09:00.080 --> 09:01.140
What are you doing?

09:04.910 --> 09:05.710
I fell asleep.

09:07.030 --> 09:08.830
How could you fall asleep first?

09:11.510 --> 09:12.200
Why is

09:12.200 --> 09:14.040
this jerk so persistent?

09:14.240 --> 09:15.100
How about this?

09:15.510 --> 09:16.550
You keep snoring

09:16.790 --> 09:17.950
and set the mood,

09:18.240 --> 09:19.600
so he'll fall asleep faster.

09:19.600 --> 09:20.400
What? Did I...

09:21.030 --> 09:22.870
D-Did I snore just now?

09:24.000 --> 09:25.400
It was nearly deafening.

09:26.120 --> 09:27.450
Stop talking nonsense.

09:27.510 --> 09:28.870
I'm the quietest

09:28.870 --> 09:30.130
and stillest sleeper.

09:31.150 --> 09:32.200
Can't you fake snoring?

09:32.200 --> 09:33.360
I don't know how to snore.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.270
How can I fake it?

09:34.270 --> 09:35.240
You do it. Come on.

09:35.240 --> 09:36.080
Y-You do it.

09:36.080 --> 09:38.340
I-It's so hard to get you to do something.

10:12.200 --> 10:14.000
I told you this trick would work.

10:14.300 --> 10:15.030
Let's go now.

10:21.000 --> 10:22.060
What are you doing?

10:26.070 --> 10:26.690
Oh, my god.

10:27.480 --> 10:28.360
He fell asleep?

10:35.480 --> 10:36.180
Keep going.

10:36.270 --> 10:38.530
Don't you feel we left something behind?

10:40.080 --> 10:41.340
Why did we come up here?

10:41.440 --> 10:42.200
We came up because of him.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.000
The suitcase!

10:44.000 --> 10:44.750
Holy.

10:46.670 --> 10:47.840
You can't do anything right!

10:47.840 --> 10:48.640
Just a moment.

10:49.670 --> 10:50.260
All you do is sleep.

10:50.260 --> 10:50.860
Hold this.

10:52.440 --> 10:54.270
You kept falling asleep.
Don't screw things up.

10:54.270 --> 10:55.330
You sure can sleep.

10:56.910 --> 10:58.240
Why am I so sleepy?

10:58.320 --> 10:59.250
I'm also sleepy!

11:05.100 --> 11:08.220
♪ The stars twinkle, the moon curves ♪

11:12.220 --> 11:16.920
♪ A gentle breeze
sways the willow branches ♪

11:19.370 --> 11:22.630
♪ The two of us, working late at night,
sneak up to the base of the wall ♪

11:31.120 --> 11:32.120
I also don't snore

11:32.720 --> 11:33.870
when I sleep.

11:41.870 --> 11:43.070
We're not going back?

11:44.200 --> 11:45.230
Don't be silly.

11:45.440 --> 11:46.270
When that guy wakes up

11:46.270 --> 11:47.240
and finds us gone,

11:47.240 --> 11:48.840
won't he go back and block us?

11:49.360 --> 11:50.620
Where are we going now?

11:51.200 --> 11:51.960
Follow me.

11:53.670 --> 11:54.940
This is my backup plan.

11:55.790 --> 11:56.840
A cunning rabbit has 3 burrows,

11:56.840 --> 11:57.370
you know?

11:57.440 --> 11:57.910
No.

12:00.270 --> 12:01.360
This is my first home

12:01.360 --> 12:02.310
in Sanjiangkou.

12:04.510 --> 12:05.570
What is this place?

12:05.630 --> 12:07.270
My home. Didn't I tell you?

12:07.600 --> 12:09.030
Why is your home so dark

12:09.080 --> 12:09.720
and full of water?

12:09.720 --> 12:11.120
It'll be fine in a minute.

12:16.770 --> 12:17.730
Oh, my.

12:18.390 --> 12:18.990
Here it is.

12:25.270 --> 12:26.400
Is it still dark now?

12:27.270 --> 12:28.120
Yeah, it's a bit better.

12:28.120 --> 12:29.480
There's a candle here, huh?

12:29.480 --> 12:30.680
The lighting system.

12:30.910 --> 12:31.840
Look over there.

12:32.320 --> 12:32.980
My kitchen.

12:34.240 --> 12:34.840
The stove.

12:37.790 --> 12:38.510
Pretty good.

12:38.510 --> 12:39.440
Let's go inside.

12:41.360 --> 12:42.180
About this part...

12:42.180 --> 12:43.020
Oh, my God.

12:43.840 --> 12:45.000
Be careful.

12:45.120 --> 12:46.720
My place has a high threshold.

12:46.720 --> 12:48.030
Your place's threshold isn't high at all.

12:48.030 --> 12:49.030
Anyone can enter.

12:51.240 --> 12:53.200
The living room and the bedroom.

12:53.870 --> 12:55.400
Sit, make yourself at home.

13:01.430 --> 13:02.630
What should we do now?

13:05.120 --> 13:05.550
Leave.

13:06.320 --> 13:07.840
We just got here, and we're leaving?

13:07.840 --> 13:08.970
Leave Sanjiangkou.

13:09.320 --> 13:10.380
We can go anywhere.

13:12.240 --> 13:13.600
Carrying a box of cash,

13:13.600 --> 13:14.750
wanting to leave Sanjiangkou,

13:14.750 --> 13:15.840
that'll be tough.

13:19.340 --> 13:20.740
Let's turn to Li Penggai.

13:21.150 --> 13:22.200
He works for Zhou Rong.

13:22.200 --> 13:23.320
He must have connections.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.200
He won't help us.

13:24.200 --> 13:24.870
Did you forget

13:24.870 --> 13:26.330
how we treated him before?

13:26.440 --> 13:26.770
Well,

13:27.200 --> 13:28.670
we'll just return the money to him

13:28.670 --> 13:29.930
and give him a bit more.

13:30.080 --> 13:31.080
Why wouldn't he help?

13:31.080 --> 13:32.110
If you say so,

13:32.550 --> 13:33.840
why didn't we just give the money
to Du Cong

13:33.840 --> 13:35.240
instead of wasting time with him?

13:35.240 --> 13:36.340
Who the hell is he?

13:36.550 --> 13:38.000
I just won't give it to him.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.080
That bastard.

13:39.440 --> 13:41.040
Indeed, don't give it to him.

13:41.270 --> 13:42.960
He even tried to hack us with a knife.

13:42.960 --> 13:43.480
Right?

13:43.480 --> 13:44.550
No way we give it to him!

13:44.550 --> 13:45.840
Men have got to be tough.

13:45.840 --> 13:46.480
Tough.

13:46.550 --> 13:47.320
Absolutely tough.

13:47.320 --> 13:47.820
Right?

13:47.870 --> 13:48.790
Mao, your toughness

13:48.790 --> 13:49.410
is right.

13:49.600 --> 13:50.290
Keep it up.

13:50.510 --> 13:51.320
I'll call Li Penggai

13:51.320 --> 13:51.720
right now.

13:51.720 --> 13:52.150
Right.

13:53.000 --> 13:53.860
Take the money.

13:54.150 --> 13:54.950
We have money.

13:55.960 --> 13:56.440
Right?

13:57.550 --> 13:58.480
Li Penggai.

14:02.900 --> 14:03.900
Hello, boss man.

14:05.600 --> 14:06.940
I-It's me, Mao.

14:06.970 --> 14:07.570
Goodness.

14:08.900 --> 14:09.470
Yes, yes.

14:09.950 --> 14:11.720
The m-money is ready.

14:11.840 --> 14:12.740
Yes, we have it.

14:13.470 --> 14:14.830
I'll send you a location in a bit.

14:14.830 --> 14:15.720
Come over and get it,

14:15.720 --> 14:16.390
please.

14:17.360 --> 14:18.150
Okay, okay.

14:18.390 --> 14:18.920
Alright.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.530
Okay, thank you.

14:24.870 --> 14:26.240
Didn't you say you were tough?

14:26.240 --> 14:28.000
I was just being a little polite.

14:28.000 --> 14:29.480
That was way too fawning.

14:36.880 --> 14:37.930
Lu Yibo went

14:37.960 --> 14:39.760
to Zhou Qi's place after he left.

14:40.440 --> 14:41.320
What about Lang Bowen?

14:41.320 --> 14:42.030
He's been at the hospital

14:42.030 --> 14:43.360
without even leaving the ward.

14:43.360 --> 14:44.440
Yangyang brought him lunch

14:44.440 --> 14:45.100
and dinner.

14:45.270 --> 14:47.400
The two of them didn't contact anyone.

14:47.720 --> 14:48.850
Who else could it be?

14:49.960 --> 14:51.250
Who else?

14:51.750 --> 14:52.290
Mr. Zhou,

14:52.630 --> 14:54.270
why don't we start with those two guys

14:54.270 --> 14:55.470
wanted by the police?

14:55.960 --> 14:56.780
Who are they?

14:57.120 --> 14:57.910
Why do the police think

14:57.910 --> 14:59.030
they robbed you?

14:59.550 --> 15:00.600
If we investigate them,

15:00.600 --> 15:01.600
we might be able to find

15:01.600 --> 15:02.960
the mastermind behind them.

15:02.960 --> 15:04.030
How is that possible?

15:04.030 --> 15:05.510
Unless you have someone inside the police.

15:05.510 --> 15:07.710
Otherwise, how could you investigate?

15:20.600 --> 15:22.120
What kind of dump is this?

15:35.150 --> 15:35.600
Hello?

15:36.440 --> 15:37.200
Here, over here,

15:37.200 --> 15:37.480
Penggai!

15:37.480 --> 15:37.880
Hello?

15:37.910 --> 15:38.440
Penggai!

15:38.840 --> 15:39.500
Behind you!

15:41.370 --> 15:43.210
What are you two doing here?

15:44.240 --> 15:45.790
Thanks for coming
all the way here, Penggai.

15:45.790 --> 15:46.790
You guys are here?

15:47.630 --> 15:49.230
C-Come in and sit for a while.

15:51.730 --> 15:52.790
Penggai, this way.

15:54.360 --> 15:54.840
Well...

15:55.840 --> 15:58.460
It's literally cold and gloomy in here.

15:59.030 --> 16:00.160
It's a humble abode.

16:00.360 --> 16:00.870
Have a seat, Penggai.

16:00.870 --> 16:01.240
Sit down.

16:01.240 --> 16:02.080
Take... Take the seat of honor.

16:02.080 --> 16:02.440
Here?

16:02.480 --> 16:03.280
Seat of honor.

16:12.600 --> 16:13.360
All right.

16:13.750 --> 16:14.600
Given our years of relationship,

16:14.600 --> 16:15.720
there's no need to be polite.

16:15.720 --> 16:16.670
Where's the money?

16:16.670 --> 16:17.070
Money.

16:17.320 --> 16:17.720
Money.

16:18.030 --> 16:18.670
Right.

16:18.720 --> 16:20.270
The money... The money is here.

16:20.270 --> 16:21.200
Penggai, here's

16:21.480 --> 16:22.390
20,000 dollars.

16:22.390 --> 16:23.390
Please count it.

16:28.600 --> 16:29.660
You struck it rich?

16:32.470 --> 16:33.870
Where did you get it from?

16:33.910 --> 16:35.100
Well...

16:35.440 --> 16:36.300
Selling blood.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.120
Yes, from selling blood.

16:38.120 --> 16:38.920
We sold blood.

16:39.550 --> 16:40.810
You sold it to America?

16:41.270 --> 16:42.600
We sold it to Americans.

16:42.630 --> 16:43.120
Yes.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.840
That's the blood-selling gift pack, huh?

16:47.840 --> 16:48.080
Well...

16:48.080 --> 16:48.480
No.

16:48.480 --> 16:48.910
What?

16:48.910 --> 16:49.970
What are you doing?

16:50.790 --> 16:52.590
If I force my way to grab it today,

16:53.750 --> 16:54.750
are you two any match for me?

16:54.750 --> 16:55.360
-No.
-No.

16:55.960 --> 16:57.690
But Penggai, you can't do this.

16:57.750 --> 16:58.880
Look at your status.

16:59.150 --> 16:59.990
We are just

17:00.080 --> 17:00.880
nobodies.

17:00.910 --> 17:01.980
We're small fry.

17:02.320 --> 17:03.240
You can't snatch it like that,

17:03.240 --> 17:03.670
right?

17:05.480 --> 17:06.440
I-I definitely

17:06.480 --> 17:07.349
won't do that.

17:08.960 --> 17:10.240
What's my status now?

17:11.920 --> 17:13.089
I'm a gold-collar worker.

17:13.089 --> 17:13.750
Gold-collar.

17:13.750 --> 17:14.640
Well, Penggai...

17:14.640 --> 17:16.440
Why would I fight you for scraps?

17:17.200 --> 17:17.660
Well...

17:22.310 --> 17:22.750
Sit.

17:28.310 --> 17:28.960
Can you be

17:28.960 --> 17:29.820
honest with me?

17:31.310 --> 17:32.970
Where did it really come from?

17:36.480 --> 17:38.000
This is so much trouble! Oh, my!

17:38.000 --> 17:39.070
Wait, we'll tell you. We will.

17:39.070 --> 17:40.070
Penggai is our friend.

17:40.070 --> 17:41.030
Just tell him.

17:42.640 --> 17:44.790
Then I'll tell the whole story, Penggai.

17:44.790 --> 17:45.930
Get lost.

17:46.160 --> 17:46.960
I know you well.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.960
You're the best at making things up.

17:49.830 --> 17:50.470
Mao.

17:51.240 --> 17:51.790
Be good.

17:53.960 --> 17:54.670
Tell me

17:55.030 --> 17:56.690
where on earth you got it from.

17:57.350 --> 17:58.880
T-Then I'll tell you the story in detail,

17:58.880 --> 17:59.410
Penggai.

18:09.160 --> 18:09.830
That's how

18:10.000 --> 18:11.200
we got this suitcase.

18:13.920 --> 18:14.440
Is there a phone

18:14.440 --> 18:15.210
in here, too?

18:15.350 --> 18:15.680
Nope.

18:15.720 --> 18:16.230
No.

18:18.110 --> 18:20.440
Really... Really, there's nothing else.

18:29.490 --> 18:31.210
I'm really not lying to you.

18:31.450 --> 18:32.580
There's only money.

18:33.440 --> 18:34.050
Penggai!

18:34.080 --> 18:35.400
-Penggai.
-Wait, Penggai.

18:35.400 --> 18:36.920
Hey, what... What are you doing?

18:36.920 --> 18:37.430
Well...

18:37.640 --> 18:39.500
Aren't you a gold-collar worker?

18:40.030 --> 18:42.130
D-Didn't you say you wouldn't fight us
for scraps?

18:42.130 --> 18:43.920
I have a gold knife, believe it or not.

18:43.920 --> 18:45.000
No, no, Penggai.

18:50.030 --> 18:50.880
-Penggai.
-Penggai.

18:50.880 --> 18:51.480
You...

18:51.480 --> 18:52.160
Don't move.

18:54.200 --> 18:55.260
I'll be right back.

18:56.400 --> 18:58.130
Please l-leave us 200 dollars.

19:16.490 --> 19:17.050
Ren,

19:17.240 --> 19:18.570
I found Mr. Zhou's case.

19:18.830 --> 19:19.880
The money is there,

19:19.880 --> 19:21.240
but the phone is missing.

19:21.240 --> 19:21.720
Okay.

19:22.270 --> 19:23.100
Okay, okay.

19:23.560 --> 19:25.360
Search carefully for the phone.

19:28.960 --> 19:29.550
How is it?

19:30.640 --> 19:31.940
These two scrap dealers

19:31.940 --> 19:33.700
robbed the two who robbed you.

19:33.850 --> 19:35.200
The police didn't know they robbed

19:35.200 --> 19:36.270
the two guys who robbed you

19:36.270 --> 19:37.750
and thought they robbed you directly,

19:37.750 --> 19:38.880
so they are wanted.

19:39.640 --> 19:41.340
Robbed by two scrap dealers?

19:41.510 --> 19:42.510
Wait, are you sure?

19:42.510 --> 19:43.720
Li Penggai has already

19:43.720 --> 19:44.790
gotten the suitcase.

19:44.790 --> 19:46.160
He'll bring the people back soon,

19:46.160 --> 19:47.310
and we'll figure it out.

19:47.310 --> 19:49.330
Figure out my foot!

19:50.030 --> 19:51.030
How can we figure it out?

19:51.030 --> 19:52.690
Come on, give me the medicine.

19:52.790 --> 19:53.590
The medicine!

19:53.590 --> 19:55.390
You threw the medicine away.

19:55.460 --> 19:56.960
I'll go get more prescribed for you.

19:56.960 --> 19:57.480
Hurry!

19:57.550 --> 19:58.560
Hurry, hurry.

19:58.790 --> 19:59.640
I will hurry.

19:59.680 --> 20:00.860
I'm hurrying.

20:01.750 --> 20:03.310
Prescription drugs
must be prescribed at the hospital?

20:03.310 --> 20:04.430
Who made that rule?

20:04.510 --> 20:07.510
Do you have any compassion
as a medical practitioner?

20:08.310 --> 20:09.040
I don't care.

20:09.160 --> 20:11.440
Get the doctor up to work! Now!

20:12.110 --> 20:12.790
Tomorrow morning?

20:12.790 --> 20:14.320
Tomorrow morning won't do.

20:30.070 --> 20:30.640
Bro!

20:30.880 --> 20:31.240
Bro!

20:31.240 --> 20:31.750
Penggai.

20:31.750 --> 20:32.470
He has a knife!

20:32.470 --> 20:33.310
Where is the phone?

20:33.310 --> 20:34.270
The phone is here.

20:34.270 --> 20:34.960
The phone is here.

20:34.960 --> 20:35.680
The phone is here.

20:35.680 --> 20:36.440
I just got a new one

20:36.440 --> 20:37.240
with a color screen.

20:37.240 --> 20:37.920
I have it. I have a phone.

20:37.920 --> 20:39.120
It can take pictures.

20:41.200 --> 20:41.700
Wait.

20:42.590 --> 20:43.000
Mao...

20:43.680 --> 20:45.400
You two are totally done for, you know?

20:45.400 --> 20:46.530
That phone and money

20:46.550 --> 20:47.880
both belong to Mr. Zhou!

20:48.240 --> 20:49.350
Hand over the phone now,

20:49.350 --> 20:51.350
and I can still keep your bodies intact.

20:51.350 --> 20:51.960
If you keep

20:51.960 --> 20:52.740
playing tricks here,

20:52.740 --> 20:54.540
no one can save you two, you know?

21:16.550 --> 21:17.240
Li Penggai?

21:21.070 --> 21:22.240
Is he dead or not?

21:24.180 --> 21:25.780
Who cares if he's dead or not?

21:26.400 --> 21:27.460
I didn't touch him.

21:27.590 --> 21:28.640
I didn't do anything.

21:28.640 --> 21:29.960
Hurry, let's get out of here.

21:29.960 --> 21:31.090
Take the money away.

21:31.160 --> 21:31.590
Okay.

21:31.750 --> 21:32.280
Let's go.

21:45.070 --> 21:46.310
Who drove it away?

21:47.030 --> 21:48.000
I don't know.

21:51.590 --> 21:52.990
What about the suitcase?

21:53.440 --> 21:54.310
I don't know.

21:55.400 --> 21:56.860
Was it Li Penggai's man?

21:57.400 --> 21:58.460
Well, I don't know.

21:58.550 --> 21:59.830
Do you even know anything?

21:59.830 --> 22:00.820
Don't, don't...

22:01.110 --> 22:02.170
What are you doing?

22:03.510 --> 22:04.710
What should we do now?

22:09.200 --> 22:10.060
Let's run away.

22:10.310 --> 22:10.790
Let's go.

22:10.790 --> 22:11.390
Let's run.

22:21.400 --> 22:23.240
What could be in here?

22:23.720 --> 22:24.830
He gave

22:24.830 --> 22:27.240
1 million dollars to us
without blinking an eye.

22:27.240 --> 22:28.240
There must be something

22:28.240 --> 22:29.680
that threatens him in it.

22:31.310 --> 22:31.920
No!

22:34.200 --> 22:36.500
You can take all the money
in that suitcase.

22:36.500 --> 22:38.230
Can you leave the phone behind?

22:39.340 --> 22:40.490
What could it be?

22:42.320 --> 22:44.050
What's usually kept on a phone?

22:47.480 --> 22:48.880
-Videos.
-Adult videos.

22:50.030 --> 22:50.760
What videos?

22:52.110 --> 22:53.350
J-Just

22:53.550 --> 22:55.200
the videos you mentioned.

22:57.590 --> 22:58.750
It must be a sex tape

22:58.790 --> 22:59.880
of him and a woman.

23:01.880 --> 23:03.870
Can a sex tape with a woman

23:03.920 --> 23:05.070
threaten him?

23:06.440 --> 23:07.350
What makes Zhou Rong,

23:07.350 --> 23:08.200
the richest man, stand out

23:08.200 --> 23:09.330
from everyone else?

23:09.830 --> 23:11.090
He looks like a gigolo?

23:13.350 --> 23:15.410
Only a little better looking than me.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.720
His muscles

23:19.010 --> 23:20.540
aren't impressive as well.

23:21.550 --> 23:22.480
I suspect he just

23:22.480 --> 23:23.160
hooked up

23:23.160 --> 23:24.640
with a powerful older woman.

23:24.640 --> 23:26.840
He used his body to get where he is today.

23:29.640 --> 23:31.790
If the phone has a sex video

23:31.830 --> 23:33.430
of him and the older woman...

23:36.060 --> 23:37.020
20 million.

23:38.270 --> 23:39.870
If he doesn't pay 20 million,

23:40.960 --> 23:42.620
we'll expose the older woman.

23:43.570 --> 23:45.340
[A Collection of Classic Jokes]

23:46.140 --> 23:47.130
It's not funny anymore.

23:46.670 --> 23:47.240
[The World of Laughter]
[Infinite Foolishness and Fun]

23:48.720 --> 23:49.980
This is not funny.

23:50.030 --> 23:50.600
[A Collection of Classic Jokes]

23:53.590 --> 23:55.120
Why is it not funny anymore?

23:58.830 --> 23:59.590
Not funny.

24:04.400 --> 24:04.800
Hello?

24:05.090 --> 24:07.140
Hello, is it Mr. Zhou?

24:07.750 --> 24:08.410
Who are you?

24:09.400 --> 24:10.370
Mr. Zhou,

24:10.440 --> 24:12.230
you forgot us so quickly.

24:12.750 --> 24:14.950
You don't even want your phone anymore?

24:17.750 --> 24:18.350
Hello?

24:20.110 --> 24:21.250
Say something.

24:23.480 --> 24:24.680
Give me my phone back.

24:25.590 --> 24:27.050
How much money do you want?

24:29.110 --> 24:30.550
20 million, deal or no deal?

24:30.550 --> 24:31.720
20 million?

24:31.880 --> 24:32.820
Final offer.

24:32.960 --> 24:34.140
Accept it if you agree.

24:34.140 --> 24:34.790
If you don't,

24:34.790 --> 24:36.810
we'll secretly upload the stuff

24:37.070 --> 24:38.670
on the phone to the internet.

24:40.480 --> 24:41.310
Did you figure out

24:41.310 --> 24:43.170
the password to unlock the phone?

24:43.720 --> 24:44.480
Is it hard?

24:48.240 --> 24:49.440
I really want to know

24:49.790 --> 24:51.350
what's in this phone

24:51.350 --> 24:52.750
that's worth 20 million!

24:53.790 --> 24:54.510
Testing me?

24:55.440 --> 24:57.370
There's a lot of stuff in the phone.

24:57.640 --> 24:59.470
The valuable one is a video.

25:02.920 --> 25:04.110
W-What video?

25:05.790 --> 25:07.350
How am I supposed to describe it?

25:07.350 --> 25:08.680
It's way too thrilling.

25:10.480 --> 25:12.000
You still want to deny this?

25:12.000 --> 25:13.260
Can you really deny it?

25:16.260 --> 25:16.670
[The World's Jokes]

25:19.310 --> 25:19.790
Do it!

25:20.590 --> 25:21.660
Mr. Zhou! Mr. Zhou!

25:21.750 --> 25:22.310
The medicine!

25:22.310 --> 25:23.510
Here's the medicine!

25:25.880 --> 25:26.350
Do it!

25:27.680 --> 25:28.810
Don't get worked up.

25:29.750 --> 25:31.070
I mean, I'll give you 20 million.
Let's do it.

25:31.070 --> 25:31.880
How do we trade?

25:31.880 --> 25:33.010
And when do we trade?

25:37.310 --> 25:38.440
Get the money ready.

25:38.440 --> 25:39.970
I'll contact you tomorrow.

25:55.160 --> 25:56.680
Li Penggai just found those two.

25:56.680 --> 25:58.340
How did these two pop up again?

25:59.310 --> 26:00.240
What's going on?

26:00.590 --> 26:01.870
How come?

26:02.750 --> 26:04.810
Li Penggai should be back by now, huh?

26:18.940 --> 26:19.980
[Ren]

26:21.300 --> 26:22.220
[Ren]

26:24.330 --> 26:25.190
[Ren]

26:24.750 --> 26:25.950
Hello? Where are you?

26:27.100 --> 26:28.710
[Ren]

26:28.190 --> 26:29.790
I asked where you are. Speak!

26:30.200 --> 26:30.590
Li Penggai!

26:30.590 --> 26:31.750
I asked where you are!

26:31.310 --> 26:32.800
[Ren]

26:32.960 --> 26:33.720
Speak!

26:34.510 --> 26:35.120
Li Peng...

26:40.110 --> 26:40.680
Dude,

26:42.350 --> 26:44.280
you can have the 1 million dollars.

26:44.920 --> 26:46.720
Just don't hurt my friend, okay?

26:48.540 --> 26:50.360
[Ren]

26:56.070 --> 26:57.070
I know who you are.

27:00.730 --> 27:01.350
[Ren]

27:08.580 --> 27:10.070
He got taken down

27:11.310 --> 27:12.640
by two junk collectors?

27:16.640 --> 27:19.240
He actually got taken down
by junk collectors.

27:21.640 --> 27:22.790
How could he get taken down

27:22.790 --> 27:24.120
by two junk collectors?

27:24.920 --> 27:26.070
And got robbed!

27:25.610 --> 27:27.630
[We want to hitch a ride
to leave Sanjiangkou.]

27:33.400 --> 27:34.140
There's a car coming.

27:34.140 --> 27:35.280
[We want to hitch a ride
to leave Sanjiangkou.]

27:35.650 --> 27:36.380
Pull over.

27:36.880 --> 27:37.720
I can hold out, Chief.

27:37.720 --> 27:38.720
I said, pull over.

27:40.240 --> 27:43.760
[We want to hitch a ride
to leave Sanjiangkou.]

27:42.620 --> 27:43.110
Here!

27:43.160 --> 27:43.830
B-Bro.

27:49.780 --> 27:50.680
Mao Hongwei?

27:53.830 --> 27:54.670
Xia Tinggang?

27:59.070 --> 27:59.480
Drive.

28:01.150 --> 28:05.650
♪ Throw a toy to
that bunch of brokers in town ♪

28:04.670 --> 28:08.310
[We want to hitch a ride
to leave Sanjiangkou.]

28:09.580 --> 28:13.420
♪ From doubt, I forge a weapon ♪

28:15.270 --> 28:15.830
Where to?

28:16.700 --> 28:18.000
Anywhere out of Sanjiangkou will do.

28:16.970 --> 28:18.340
♪ Oh, god ♪

28:18.070 --> 28:18.680
Anywhere.

28:18.710 --> 28:19.710
Anywhere will do.

28:20.190 --> 28:22.570
♪ Please give me some guidance ♪

28:20.480 --> 28:21.120
Get in.

28:22.350 --> 28:23.380
What a nice guy!

28:23.830 --> 28:25.020
Really... Really?

28:24.110 --> 28:26.840
♪ Find the sleepy poet ♪

28:25.070 --> 28:25.570
-Great!
-Thanks.

28:25.570 --> 28:26.230
Squeeze in.

28:26.290 --> 28:27.000
Can we fit?

28:27.070 --> 28:27.830
Squeeze in. Come on.

28:27.830 --> 28:28.680
Okay, nice.

28:28.590 --> 28:30.090
♪ They are all guests ♪

28:28.720 --> 28:29.080
Good.

28:29.110 --> 28:30.270
Thank you so much. Thank you.

28:30.270 --> 28:30.880
Don't bother

28:30.880 --> 28:31.830
getting out of the car!

28:31.830 --> 28:32.720
It's fine. Get in.

28:32.720 --> 28:33.400
Thank you so much.

28:33.400 --> 28:34.660
Where are you heading?

28:34.750 --> 28:35.410
Just get in.

28:38.720 --> 28:39.160
I...

28:40.920 --> 28:45.240
♪ Throw a toy to
that bunch of brokers in town ♪

28:49.210 --> 28:52.640
♪ From doubt, I forge a weapon ♪

28:53.130 --> 28:54.360
♪ Oh, god ♪

28:56.720 --> 28:58.140
♪ Oh, god ♪

29:00.020 --> 29:02.420
♪ Please give me some guidance ♪

29:01.550 --> 29:02.280
Take it slow.

29:04.000 --> 29:06.750
♪ Find the sleepy poet ♪

29:08.080 --> 29:08.830
Wait, uncle.

29:08.150 --> 29:09.680
♪ They are all guests ♪

29:08.850 --> 29:09.530
Be careful.

29:10.920 --> 29:11.580
Over there!

29:11.830 --> 29:12.310
It's over there.

29:12.310 --> 29:13.240
Watch your steps.

29:13.240 --> 29:14.070
There's space ahead.

29:14.070 --> 29:15.110
Let's go take shelter.

29:14.410 --> 29:17.010
♪ There's a strange, hazy feeling ♪

29:18.390 --> 29:19.970
♪ Waiting for me to make sense of it ♪

29:20.110 --> 29:20.550
Mind your steps.

29:20.480 --> 29:22.760
♪ Worshippers hiding in the smoke,
just beyond reach ♪

29:21.000 --> 29:21.960
Be careful.

29:21.960 --> 29:22.690
Take it slow.

29:25.060 --> 29:26.720
♪ They are all guests ♪

29:27.270 --> 29:28.000
Go upstairs.

29:28.270 --> 29:29.330
Let's go upstairs.

29:29.660 --> 29:31.430
♪ Be patient and wait ♪

29:33.400 --> 29:34.590
What are you two doing?

29:34.590 --> 29:35.390
Don't come up!

29:36.960 --> 29:37.670
Sir,

29:38.200 --> 29:39.530
I have an old man with me.

29:39.550 --> 29:40.720
It's raining outside.

29:40.720 --> 29:42.000
We just want to go up
to take shelter from the rain.

29:42.000 --> 29:43.640
We'll leave when the rain stops.

29:43.640 --> 29:44.700
Cut the crap.

29:44.960 --> 29:46.810
All my assets are up here.

29:46.960 --> 29:48.770
I don't trust you two coming up.

29:49.110 --> 29:50.700
I'll kill you.

29:50.830 --> 29:52.080
How dare you?

29:52.110 --> 29:53.480
Come on, kill me. Come on!

29:53.480 --> 29:54.080
I...

29:54.200 --> 29:54.720
Enough!

29:55.070 --> 29:55.880
Uncle, I...

29:55.880 --> 29:56.550
Come down.

29:57.440 --> 29:58.040
Come down.

30:00.310 --> 30:01.510
-We're not going up.
-I'll kill you.

30:01.510 --> 30:02.640
We won't bother you.

30:03.680 --> 30:05.040
Did you eat crap?

30:05.070 --> 30:06.470
You're so foul-mouthed.

30:07.200 --> 30:07.950
Uncle,

30:08.160 --> 30:09.560
why aren't we going up?

30:10.290 --> 30:11.780
I can just kill him!

30:12.830 --> 30:14.450
What happens if we go up?

30:14.720 --> 30:15.400
It's fine.

30:15.590 --> 30:17.270
What happens if we kill him?

30:17.350 --> 30:18.280
If word gets out,

30:18.480 --> 30:19.430
it's indecent

30:19.550 --> 30:21.280
for the two of us

30:21.550 --> 30:23.550
to fight a beggar for turf!

30:24.070 --> 30:24.510
Uncle,

30:25.830 --> 30:27.490
are we decent now?

30:28.680 --> 30:30.700
Wasn't this a pure accident?

30:31.310 --> 30:32.750
That... That guy surnamed Hu.

30:32.750 --> 30:33.750
Hu.. What's he called again?

30:33.750 --> 30:34.430
Jianren.

30:34.590 --> 30:35.640
Scumbag! (Sounds like Jianren.)

30:35.640 --> 30:37.970
He is the only one
who knows your identity!

30:38.070 --> 30:39.530
If Zhou Rong didn't snitch,

30:39.530 --> 30:41.730
why would the police want to arrest you?

30:44.640 --> 30:46.770
I can bear with him snatching my goods!

30:47.400 --> 30:48.370
But snitching is

30:48.830 --> 30:50.210
a big taboo in the underworld.

30:50.210 --> 30:51.210
It's despicable!

30:53.480 --> 30:54.880
Call Zhou Rong

30:54.960 --> 30:56.890
and tell him we'll trade tomorrow.

31:01.590 --> 31:02.340
Uncle,

31:03.310 --> 31:05.030
we don't have the bianzhong anymore.

31:05.030 --> 31:06.430
How can we trade with him?

31:07.110 --> 31:09.660
Tomorrow's trade isn't for money.

31:10.400 --> 31:11.970
It's to take his life.

31:13.720 --> 31:14.660
Mr. Zhou,

31:15.310 --> 31:16.230
no matter what,

31:17.440 --> 31:19.300
we must make this trade tomorrow.

31:20.000 --> 31:20.750
You may rest now.

31:20.750 --> 31:22.150
I'll go prepare the cash.

31:22.310 --> 31:22.640
Wait,

31:22.640 --> 31:24.170
where will you get the cash?

31:25.030 --> 31:25.560
Mr. Zhou.

31:30.550 --> 31:32.680
We can only ask the suppliers for cash.

31:32.850 --> 31:34.920
If I contact a few more,
it should be enough.

31:34.920 --> 31:35.830
I'll have them deliver it

31:35.830 --> 31:37.350
to the company tomorrow morning.

31:37.350 --> 31:38.750
Okay. Thanks for your hard work.

31:38.750 --> 31:39.550
It's nothing.

31:41.550 --> 31:42.750
The phone is ringing.

31:43.880 --> 31:44.920
Can you answer it?

31:55.480 --> 31:56.340
It's Zhu Yifei.

32:07.070 --> 32:07.720
Mr. Zhu,

32:08.680 --> 32:10.340
why are you still up this late?

32:11.510 --> 32:13.170
Mr. Zhou, sorry to bother you.

32:13.920 --> 32:15.720
What are you doing right now?

32:17.350 --> 32:18.550
I'm taking a hot bath.

32:20.350 --> 32:22.880
He said he's taking a hot bath.

32:27.920 --> 32:28.760
Mr. Zhou.

32:30.790 --> 32:32.760
We have everything ready.

32:32.830 --> 32:34.310
Let's trade tomorrow.

32:39.120 --> 32:40.230
Mr. Zhu, didn't you say

32:40.230 --> 32:42.090
you were not going to sell it to me?

32:42.200 --> 32:44.130
I was just being impulsive.

32:44.160 --> 32:45.070
Think about it.

32:45.270 --> 32:47.590
Who else would I sell it to
other than you?

32:51.000 --> 32:52.750
H-How do we trade?

32:53.000 --> 32:54.660
Tomorrow at 10 AM,

32:54.790 --> 32:56.240
we'll meet at the abandoned building

32:56.240 --> 32:57.570
in the western suburbs.

32:58.110 --> 32:59.070
You bring the money here.

32:59.070 --> 33:00.480
Be there or be square.

33:04.110 --> 33:04.770
It's a deal.

33:12.510 --> 33:13.770
What is Zhu Yifei up to?

33:14.270 --> 33:16.110
Can you stop asking me

33:16.110 --> 33:16.980
questions?

33:17.030 --> 33:18.590
Let him do whatever he wants!

33:18.590 --> 33:19.760
None of you should

33:19.790 --> 33:21.650
ask me any questions today, okay?

33:28.120 --> 33:28.840
Mr. Zhou.

33:31.000 --> 33:31.800
M-Mr. Zhou...

33:33.270 --> 33:33.800
Mr. Zhou.

33:36.720 --> 33:37.680
Can you let me

33:37.680 --> 33:39.160
bathe in the seawater of Gondwana

33:39.160 --> 33:40.920
for a while longer?

33:42.790 --> 33:43.240
Okay.

33:44.960 --> 33:45.440
Go on.

33:48.830 --> 33:49.890
Go ahead and bathe.

34:27.760 --> 34:28.639
Chief Zhang.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.670
Thank you so much.

34:32.190 --> 34:33.320
National treasure...

34:33.320 --> 34:34.800
It is a national treasure!

34:34.880 --> 34:36.280
This is what we should do.

34:36.670 --> 34:37.400
Chief Zhang,

34:38.110 --> 34:39.710
I will compose a poem for you.

34:43.340 --> 34:44.670
What rhyme should I use?

34:47.250 --> 34:48.040
Curator Guo,

34:48.070 --> 34:49.010
h-how about this?

34:49.010 --> 34:50.639
Y-You can go to my office.

34:50.710 --> 34:51.730
There are pens in my room,

34:51.730 --> 34:52.530
as well as ink.

34:52.590 --> 34:53.960
You can compose a poem anytime.

34:53.960 --> 34:55.820
They still have to solve the case.

34:57.150 --> 34:57.960
After the case is solved,

34:57.960 --> 34:58.710
I will go visit you,

34:58.710 --> 35:00.040
and we can recite a poem.

35:00.110 --> 35:00.570
Yes, yes.

35:00.570 --> 35:01.740
Sorry, sorry.

35:01.880 --> 35:03.010
I'll leave you to it.

35:09.440 --> 35:09.920
Chief.

35:11.440 --> 35:12.480
The interrogation is over.

35:12.480 --> 35:13.610
How are the results?

35:13.710 --> 35:14.710
See for yourself.

35:16.070 --> 35:17.120
[Interrogation Record]

35:17.120 --> 35:21.230
[Details of the Interrogation Record]

35:24.440 --> 35:25.570
Mao and Xia Tinggang

35:26.280 --> 35:28.540
have nothing to do with Zhou Rong's case?

35:32.880 --> 35:34.510
They have nothing to do
with Liu Bei's death either.

35:34.510 --> 35:35.370
Nothing at all.

35:35.480 --> 35:36.880
Then why are you so happy?

35:36.880 --> 35:37.810
It's Li Penggai.

35:38.070 --> 35:38.670
Li Penggai crashed

35:38.670 --> 35:39.760
into the bianzhong himself.

35:39.760 --> 35:41.890
But we don't know if he's dead or alive.

35:42.840 --> 35:43.800
Then hurry up and go.

35:43.800 --> 35:44.880
Have Li Qian go with you.

35:44.880 --> 35:45.410
Yes, sir.

36:21.280 --> 36:22.210
Where is the car?

36:22.280 --> 36:23.140
Where's my car?

36:44.710 --> 36:46.370
Are you sure this is the place?

36:47.590 --> 36:48.510
Y-Yes.

36:49.110 --> 36:49.640
Let's go.

37:10.190 --> 37:11.290
He should be alive

37:11.480 --> 37:12.740
and probably ran away.

37:34.880 --> 37:35.320
Hello?

37:35.400 --> 37:36.060
Who is this?

37:36.400 --> 37:38.260
Hello, this is Gao Dong speaking.

37:39.000 --> 37:39.480
Chief.

37:40.630 --> 37:41.690
It's Director Gao.

37:41.960 --> 37:42.890
Don't answer it.

37:43.070 --> 37:44.270
Tell him I'm not here.

37:45.360 --> 37:47.560
Director Gao, Chief Zhang said he's...

37:49.790 --> 37:50.590
Here he comes.

37:52.510 --> 37:53.310
Director Gao.

37:54.000 --> 37:55.530
The interrogation's over.

37:56.480 --> 37:57.920
These two people should have nothing

37:57.920 --> 37:59.450
to do with Zhou Rong's case.

37:59.800 --> 38:00.670
And they probably have nothing

38:00.670 --> 38:02.530
to do with Liu Bei's death either.

38:03.280 --> 38:04.440
But we did find something.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.440
We found the bianzhong,

38:05.440 --> 38:06.440
the complete set.

38:06.440 --> 38:07.550
The antique trafficker is called
Zhu Yifei.

38:07.550 --> 38:08.800
We've issued an arrest warrant.

38:08.800 --> 38:10.460
Huo Zheng works for Zhu Yifei.

38:11.630 --> 38:13.230
What about Fang Chao and Liu Zhi?

38:13.230 --> 38:14.560
Still looking for them.

38:15.480 --> 38:16.110
Can you give me a result

38:16.110 --> 38:17.150
by noon today?

38:19.300 --> 38:20.250
Now...

38:21.150 --> 38:22.920
He wants us to give him a result by noon.

38:22.920 --> 38:23.960
Then recite poetry.

38:23.960 --> 38:24.490
Sit down.

38:26.280 --> 38:27.080
Director Gao,

38:27.590 --> 38:28.450
this is Li Qian.

38:29.190 --> 38:31.220
I have something to report to you.

38:31.800 --> 38:32.330
Go ahead.

38:33.280 --> 38:34.960
Letting Fang Chao and Liu Zhi go

38:34.960 --> 38:36.560
wasn't Chief Zhang's fault.

38:40.240 --> 38:41.710
Song Xing and I acted
without authorization,

38:41.710 --> 38:43.170
which is why they got away.

38:43.800 --> 38:44.960
Chief Zhang said that

38:44.960 --> 38:46.510
just so we wouldn't feel pressured.

38:46.510 --> 38:48.110
He's taking the blame for us.

38:48.920 --> 38:49.550
Stop it.

38:49.670 --> 38:50.880
Everything Li Qian said is true.

38:50.880 --> 38:51.800
If you hadn't talked nonsense,

38:51.800 --> 38:53.550
would the Chief have been pushed
to this extent?

38:53.550 --> 38:54.350
Director Gao,

38:54.880 --> 38:55.760
what you're doing

38:55.760 --> 38:57.160
is unfair to Chief Zhang.

38:57.710 --> 38:58.510
If someone has to be punished,

38:58.510 --> 38:59.710
it should be us first.

39:16.510 --> 39:18.070
So, regarding the deadline
to catch Zhou Rong,

39:18.070 --> 39:19.530
can it be extended a bit...

39:19.880 --> 39:20.670
Hello, Director Gao.

39:20.670 --> 39:22.030
We can catch Zhou Rong by noon today.

39:22.030 --> 39:23.230
I'll get back to work.

39:23.920 --> 39:24.800
Get the surveillance footage

39:24.800 --> 39:26.070
of Lu Yibo leaving the Municipal Bureau

39:26.070 --> 39:26.800
yesterday.

39:34.620 --> 39:38.240
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]
[Gate 2]

39:38.400 --> 39:38.800
Pause.

39:43.280 --> 39:44.540
Investigate this car.

39:54.130 --> 39:57.740
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

39:56.700 --> 39:58.300
It's Rongcheng Group's car.

39:59.230 --> 39:59.630
Right.

39:59.760 --> 40:00.760
That makes sense.

40:00.800 --> 40:01.630
Lu Yibo drove his own car

40:01.630 --> 40:02.630
when he came yesterday.

40:02.630 --> 40:03.360
When he left,

40:03.550 --> 40:05.110
he got into Rongcheng Group's car.

40:05.110 --> 40:06.110
Zhou Rong wanted to know

40:06.110 --> 40:07.500
what Lu Yibo told us.

40:07.670 --> 40:09.200
Lu Yibo stayed at our bureau

40:09.230 --> 40:09.890
for a day,

40:09.920 --> 40:11.120
and we didn't see him.

40:11.150 --> 40:11.920
If he went back

40:11.920 --> 40:13.190
and told Zhou Rong that,

40:13.190 --> 40:14.960
Zhou Rong definitely wouldn't believe it.

40:14.960 --> 40:15.740
After all,

40:16.070 --> 40:18.200
Lu Yibo has a history of betraying him.

40:20.110 --> 40:22.110
Even the most impregnable fortress

40:22.110 --> 40:24.000
cannot withstand an internal collapse.

40:24.000 --> 40:25.280
So their mistrust of each other

40:25.280 --> 40:26.810
is our breakthrough point.

40:27.360 --> 40:27.960
Song Xing.

40:28.320 --> 40:29.230
You're the biggest contributor

40:29.230 --> 40:29.760
to this case.

40:29.760 --> 40:30.230
Really?

40:31.480 --> 40:32.750
We'll go find Lu Yibo now.

40:32.750 --> 40:33.280
No.

40:33.840 --> 40:35.640
We're going to visit Lang Bowen.

40:36.070 --> 40:37.130
Everyone is going.

40:41.880 --> 40:43.030
How unpredictable.

40:44.800 --> 40:45.480
Look!

40:52.480 --> 40:54.000
What happened?

40:54.190 --> 40:55.850
So many police cars have come!

40:55.880 --> 40:56.940
With all this fuss,

40:57.360 --> 40:59.290
something big must have happened.

41:05.920 --> 41:06.760
Chief Zhang,

41:07.280 --> 41:08.680
do we need so many people?

41:10.360 --> 41:11.220
Are there many?

41:12.110 --> 41:12.630
No.

41:46.880 --> 41:47.940
You keep watch here

41:48.070 --> 41:49.670
and don't let anyone get close.

41:49.670 --> 41:50.110
Yes, sir.
